{
  "name": "Cold Storage",
  "notes": [
    "SONG 10 — \"Cold Storage\" (WAVY, audition candidate): slow cold menace for",
    "tense floors. C# natural minor, 78 BPM. A pedal-tone saw bass and a",
    "retriggered low pad drone hold the root while a 12-step (dotted-8th) sine",
    "motif — C#, G#, D# (the major 9th) — phases 3-against-4 over the bar,",
    "realigning every 3 bars. The \"veil\" sections shift the pad up one scale",
    "step (degree 1: D#-F#-A# over the C# pedal = the m9/m11 wash); \"sink\"",
    "finally moves the harmony i - i - VI - VII. Long arcs, sparse drums.",
    "",
    "pattern cold_bass_pedal: Heartbeat pedal on the tonic: beat 1, the \"and\" of 2,",
    "and beat 3.",
    "",
    "pattern cold_pad_drone: The drone bed: the i triad retriggered every beat so",
    "the slow pad attacks overlap into a continuous low wash.",
    "",
    "pattern cold_motif: The 3-against-4 motif: a 12-step lane (3 beats) looping",
    "inside 64-step (4-bar) sections — it drifts across the barline and realigns",
    "every 3 bars. Pitches C#3 / G#3 / D#3: degree 8 is the major 9th, the color",
    "note."
  ],
